@startuml
title HTQLHDK - System context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Nguoi dung\n7 vai tro" as User
actor "SCAN_OPS" as Ops
rectangle "He thong quan ly quet\nlo hong website dinh ky" as System
cloud "IdP cua don vi\nOIDC" as IdP
rectangle "OWASP ZAP\nben ngoai" as ZAP
database "PostgreSQL 17" as DB
storage "Kho object private\nraw/evidence/export" as OBJ
rectangle "KMS / Secrets Manager" as KMS
rectangle "Telemetry da loc" as OBS

User --> System : HTTPS / Web UI
System --> IdP : OIDC
Ops --> ZAP : Chay quet ben ngoai
ZAP --> Ops : Traditional JSON/XML
Ops --> System : Upload report
System --> DB : Du lieu + workflow + audit
System --> OBJ : Tep ma hoa
System --> KMS : Secret / key operation
System --> OBS : Log, metric, trace an toan

note bottom of ZAP
System KHONG khoi chay, dung
hoac dieu khien ZAP
end note
@enduml

